planning-mds/features/F0006-assertion-plane-origin-and-interpretation-basis/PRD.md:34:4. Storage/contract safeguards and review hooks for mood and evidence origin. Mood-bearing claims are ineligible for canonical facts. Described-only evidence cannot auto-accept, close, or supersede a fact; it requires `DESCRIBED_EVIDENCE` review. Operative provisions of an issued policy remain facts about that contract.
